    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare dated marine assemblage turnover horizons among regions and climates using shared taxa and compositional change. Estimate global synchronicity relative to dating uncertainty and test whether fossil-based correlations outperform geography or climate alone.";
