    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "'Almost simultaneously' is scale-dependent.", "Biochronological dating can be circular when fossils also define ages.";
